Z||000000||JAMIE||08-17-2000||10:26 AM||||I am sure many forum members are familiar with Fierodave and know what a great guy he is. Dave has done so much for me and my 88GT restoration project and I just want to thank him in front of the Fiero community . He has helped me find many of those hard to find,new GM original parts at great prices. He is definitely one of the most honest,knowledgeable and reliable people I have ever dealt with. Dave - thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||08-17-2000||11:03 AM||||Well, I second those thoughts -- Dave IS a great guy - more trouble than he's worth (private joke between Dave and me) but he's a great guy anyway!! -- and dave, in response to your last email to me -- I can ask too!!!<P>He is a great source for parts but also a great source for knowledge -- 2 1/2 cheers for Dave!!! (the other half cheer is on its way!!)||||reg||1
